From 662e498bd1117022b9787bcd04ec550a9accf254 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Lee <joseph.lee@xanadu.ai>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:37:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Add Backline QPM: reserve QEC controllers, decoders and
 transports

A client-executed QPM. reserve() matches a resource_intent against the
site inventory, commits the reservation through UTIL_QPM, and returns the
placement the client builds its Backline nodes from. get_reservation()
carries the placement while the reservation is active; release() and
expiry free the inventory entries. Execution calls are refused.

No changes to QFw core.
